&lt;p&gt;Al Montseny amb la càmera &lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/iHhn3itvx9uvTRHL6"&gt;Lomo Sprocket Rocket&lt;/a&gt;, panoràmiques amb foradets&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Autumn day photo at Montseny mountain</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2012/10/30/autumn-day-photo-at-montseny-mountain/</link><pubDate>Tue, 30 Oct 2012 00:00:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2012/10/30/autumn-day-photo-at-montseny-mountain/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/P9xt1KTm2v3UrfBB9"&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.pocallum.cat/wp-content/uploads/2012/10/8454-Diana-Pinhole-011.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
